4000;11;사이클 타임 MCU-업데이트(% 1 %%)를 초과했습니다.;Not enough computing time for the motion interpolator update available in the system.;Check configuration and timing of your system. If possible reduce performance of the application or increase the configured cycle time of the motion interpolator. Provide information to your distributor: create a status report and send it to your distributor.
